## ✅ Deployment Checklist

**Prima di ogni `git push origin main`:**

- [ ] Feature è completa (non work-in-progress)
- [ ] PROGRESS.md aggiornato (feature + file changes + test notes)
- [ ] Test locale: tutti gli user flow funzionano
- [ ] Gemini/FatSecret/Dropbox API chiavi corrette in `.dev.vars`
- [ ] No console.error/warn (solo logs intenzionali)
- [ ] Responsive tested (mobile + tablet + desktop)
- [ ] Offline mode testato (PWA; simulate offline in DevTools)
- [ ] Accessibility check (ARIA labels, keyboard nav)
- [ ] No breaking changes a Dropbox schema (oppure migration documentata)

**Push + Deploy:**

```bash
git add -A
git commit -m "feat: [feature] — [scope]"
git push origin main

# Attendi GitHub Actions CI (3–5 min)
# Verifica: https://github.com/yourusername/recipe-book/actions

# Deploy manual (se GA non funziona):
wrangler deploy  # Worker
cd frontend && npm run build
wrangler pages deploy dist/

# Test prod: https://recipe-book.pages.dev
# 1. Login (Dropbox)
# 2. Create recipe (manual or scraper)
# 3. Check Dropbox sync
# 4. Add shopping list item
# 5. Settings (theme change)

# Aggiorna PROGRESS.md con ✅ Prod (+ timestamp)
git add PROGRESS.md
git commit -m "docs: session update [DATE]"
git push origin main
```

