## 🧪 Testing Checklist

### Per feature:

1. **Happy path (normal uso):**
   - [ ] Feature funziona come atteso
   - [ ] Dropbox sync avviene (check `/Apps/Recipe Book/` folder)
   - [ ] Zustand state persista su reload

2. **Edge cases:**
   - [ ] Input vuoto / invalido (validation)
   - [ ] Offline mode (PWA; DevTools Network → Offline)
   - [ ] Rate limiting (429 → retry)
   - [ ] Expired JWT (logout + re-login)

3. **Multi-user:**
   - [ ] superUser vede ricette altrui
   - [ ] User vede solo ricette proprie + shared
   - [ ] User non può delete ricetta altrui

4. **Responsive:**
   - [ ] Mobile (375px width)
   - [ ] Tablet (768px)
   - [ ] Desktop (1400px)

### Before deploy:

```bash
# Build check
npm run build

# No console errors
# Check DevTools Console (prod URL)

# Dropbox OAuth
# Try login flow (fresh browser; clear cookies)

# Network tab
# Check no exposed secrets
# Verify Worker is responding

# Lighthouse
# Perf > 80, Accessibility > 90
```

